{"id":"4.3","title":"Skal vi møtes en dag?","audio":"audio/4.3.mp3","duration":127.92,"synthetic":false,"sentences":[{"id":0,"start":0.15,"end":3.97,"text":"4.3 Skal vi møtes en dag?","heading":true,"zh":"4.3 我们哪天见个面好吗？","words":[[0,3,0.15,1.2,"4.3"],[4,8,2.12,2.58,"skal~d1b9dc119407"],[9,11,2.58,2.8,"vi"],[12,17,2.8,3.3,"møtes"],[18,20,3.3,3.48,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[21,24,3.48,3.89,"dag~4cbe30580433"]]},{"id":1,"start":5.37,"end":10.04,"text":"Hei, Håvard! Lenge siden sist! Hvordan går det?","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"嗨，霍瓦尔！好久不见！最近怎么样？","words":[[0,3,5.45,5.75,"hei"],[5,11,5.77,6.07,"håvard"],[13,18,7.01,7.43,"lenge"],[19,24,7.43,7.75,"siden~9a3d2d89a980"],[25,29,7.75,8.01,"sist"],[31,38,8.75,9.47,"hvordan"],[39,42,9.47,9.67,"går~2536fac625ab"],[43,46,9.67,9.96,"det~8d16156bd355"]]},{"id":2,"start":10.74,"end":13.96,"text":"Takk, det går bra! Og med deg?","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"谢谢，挺好的！你呢？","words":[[0,4,10.82,11.27,"takk"],[6,9,11.63,11.77,"det~8d16156bd355"],[10,13,11.77,11.93,"går~bdf67dea99b2"],[14,17,11.93,12.17,"bra~9ed229260de6"],[19,21,12.89,13.35,"og"],[22,25,13.35,13.49,"med~0a5bad95cb9d"],[26,29,13.49,13.88,"deg"]]},{"id":3,"start":14.33,"end":21.19,"text":"Fint, men jeg har mye å gjøre. Jeg jobber mye, og jeg har barna annenhver uke.","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"挺好，不过我有很多事要做。我工作很忙，而且每隔一周要带孩子。","words":[[0,4,14.41,14.81,"fint"],[6,9,15.57,15.75,"men"],[10,13,15.75,15.91,"jeg"],[14,17,15.91,16.11,"har"],[18,21,16.11,16.55,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"],[22,23,16.55,16.67,"å~0583da7a620a"],[24,29,16.67,16.89,"gjøre"],[31,34,17.67,17.99,"jeg"],[35,41,17.99,18.39,"jobber~003ddb6d77e6"],[42,45,18.39,18.77,"mye~933c5a923198"],[47,49,19.05,19.19,"og"],[50,53,19.19,19.29,"jeg"],[54,57,19.29,19.49,"har"],[58,63,19.49,20.03,"barna"],[64,73,20.03,20.63,"annenhver"],[74,77,20.63,21.11,"uke"]]},{"id":4,"start":21.96,"end":24.04,"text":"Å, er du skilt?","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"哦，你离婚了？","words":[[0,1,22.04,22.33,"å~496a48c13525"],[3,5,22.81,23.11,"er"],[6,8,23.11,23.27,"du"],[9,14,23.27,23.96,"skilt~39bb7cd38da8"]]},{"id":5,"start":24.33,"end":25.82,"text":"Ja, det er jeg.","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"是的，离了。","words":[[0,2,24.41,24.61,"ja"],[4,7,25.23,25.33,"det~78c46db3f5d1"],[8,10,25.33,25.51,"er"],[11,14,25.51,25.74,"jeg"]]},{"id":6,"start":26.32,"end":29.35,"text":"Hvordan går det? Er det travelt?","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"过得怎么样？很忙吗？","words":[[0,7,26.4,26.83,"hvordan"],[8,11,26.83,27.23,"går~2536fac625ab"],[12,15,27.23,27.43,"det~8d16156bd355"],[17,19,28.15,28.35,"er"],[20,23,28.35,28.47,"det"],[24,31,28.47,29.27,"travelt"]]},{"id":7,"start":29.62,"end":46.91,"text":"Ja. Jeg begynner på jobb klokka åtte og leverer barna i barnehagen og på skolen før jobb. Det er travelt, men det går bra. Jeg pleier å stå opp tidlig om morgenen, for jeg liker å ha god tid. Hva gjør du?","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"是的。我八点开始上班，上班前要把孩子们送到幼儿园和学校。很忙，但还应付得来。我通常早上很早起床，因为我喜欢时间充裕一些。你是做什么的？","words":[[0,2,29.62,30.23,"ja"],[4,7,30.83,31.23,"jeg"],[8,16,31.23,31.59,"begynner"],[17,19,31.59,31.81,"på~362b62e4a2d8"],[20,24,31.81,32.17,"jobb"],[25,31,32.17,32.47,"klokka"],[32,36,32.47,32.87,"åtte"],[37,39,33.29,33.53,"og"],[40,47,33.53,33.97,"leverer"],[48,53,33.97,34.39,"barna"],[54,55,34.39,34.49,"i"],[56,66,34.49,35.25,"barnehagen"],[67,69,35.25,35.39,"og"],[70,72,35.39,35.53,"på"],[73,79,35.53,35.95,"skolen"],[80,83,35.95,36.45,"før~f9c047e06941"],[84,88,36.45,36.75,"jobb"],[90,93,37.55,37.87,"det"],[94,96,37.87,38.03,"er"],[97,104,38.03,38.71,"travelt"],[106,109,38.79,39.03,"men"],[110,113,39.03,39.47,"det"],[114,117,39.47,39.71,"går~bdf67dea99b2"],[118,121,39.71,39.99,"bra~9ed229260de6"],[123,126,40.81,41.13,"jeg"],[127,133,41.13,41.59,"pleier"],[134,135,41.59,41.75,"å~0583da7a620a"],[136,139,41.75,41.93,"stå~3e6cceed2953"],[140,143,41.93,42.11,"opp~4bb5dba4f351"],[144,150,42.11,42.47,"tidlig"],[151,153,42.47,42.59,"om~5b93c55d689f"],[154,162,42.59,43.27,"morgenen"],[164,167,43.33,43.61,"for~a05c87659379"],[168,171,43.61,43.77,"jeg"],[172,177,43.77,44.25,"liker"],[178,179,44.25,44.37,"å~0583da7a620a"],[180,182,44.37,44.49,"ha~ca5edb8b1cdb"],[183,186,44.49,44.69,"god~3bf5a9c975f3"],[187,190,44.69,44.95,"tid"],[192,195,46.11,46.43,"hva"],[196,200,46.43,46.57,"gjør"],[201,203,46.57,46.83,"du"]]},{"id":8,"start":47.51,"end":56.66,"text":"Jeg er lærer og underviser på norskkurs, og Marit er lærer på en barneskole. Vi bor sammen.","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"我是老师，在挪威语课上教课，玛丽特是一所小学的老师。我们住在一起。","words":[[0,3,47.59,47.83,"jeg"],[4,6,47.83,47.97,"er"],[7,12,47.97,48.51,"lærer~37398342c31f"],[13,15,48.51,49.07,"og"],[16,26,49.07,49.99,"underviser"],[27,29,49.99,50.29,"på"],[30,39,50.29,50.93,"norskkurs"],[41,43,51.59,52.01,"og"],[44,49,52.01,52.57,"marit"],[50,52,52.57,52.83,"er"],[53,58,52.83,53.27,"lærer~37398342c31f"],[59,61,53.27,53.51,"på"],[62,64,53.51,53.69,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[65,75,53.69,54.45,"barneskole"],[77,79,55.52,55.84,"vi"],[80,83,55.84,56.04,"bor"],[84,90,56.04,56.58,"sammen"]]},{"id":9,"start":56.79,"end":65.6,"text":"Så hyggelig å høre. Nå må jeg skynde meg på jobb, for jeg har dårlig tid. Skal vi ta en kaffe til helga?","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"听到这个真好。我现在得赶去上班了，因为我时间很紧。我们周末一起喝杯咖啡好吗？","words":[[0,2,57.17,58.05,"så~f3a520a4cee7"],[3,11,58.05,58.41,"hyggelig"],[12,13,58.41,58.55,"å~0583da7a620a"],[14,18,58.55,58.73,"høre~98ec3649ebcb"],[20,22,59.62,59.96,"nå~d531d47a7712"],[23,25,59.96,60.18,"må"],[26,29,60.18,60.34,"jeg"],[30,36,60.34,60.74,"skynde"],[37,40,60.74,60.92,"meg"],[41,43,60.92,61.08,"på~a39e8fe4d6c1"],[44,48,61.08,61.46,"jobb"],[50,53,61.74,62.0,"for~a05c87659379"],[54,57,62.0,62.16,"jeg"],[58,61,62.16,62.34,"har"],[62,68,62.34,62.66,"dårlig~b05efbd61136"],[69,72,62.66,62.86,"tid"],[74,78,64.03,64.25,"skal~d1b9dc119407"],[79,81,64.25,64.39,"vi"],[82,84,64.39,64.53,"ta~ded79fb739d0"],[85,87,64.53,64.65,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[88,93,64.65,64.99,"kaffe"],[94,97,64.99,65.13,"til~02f653494be7"],[98,103,65.13,65.52,"helga"]]},{"id":10,"start":65.68,"end":72.04,"text":"Ja, gjerne! Jeg liker å gå på kafeen i Storgata.","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"好啊，很乐意！我喜欢去 Storgata 街的那家咖啡馆。","words":[[0,2,65.68,66.41,"ja"],[4,10,67.13,67.59,"gjerne"],[12,15,68.67,69.07,"jeg"],[16,21,69.07,69.45,"liker"],[22,23,69.45,69.57,"å~0583da7a620a"],[24,26,69.57,69.77,"gå"],[27,29,69.77,69.95,"på~3ac21efb6a73"],[30,36,69.95,70.73,"kafeen"],[37,38,70.73,71.01,"i"],[39,47,71.01,71.96,"storgata"]]},{"id":11,"start":72.73,"end":77.93,"text":"Fint! Det er en hyggelig kafé. Vi snakkes til helga.","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"好！那是一家很舒适的咖啡馆。我们周末再聊。","words":[[0,4,72.81,73.17,"fint"],[6,9,73.77,74.19,"det"],[10,12,74.19,74.57,"er"],[13,15,74.57,74.73,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[16,24,74.73,75.23,"hyggelig"],[25,29,75.23,75.61,"kafé"],[31,33,76.42,76.82,"vi"],[34,41,76.82,77.22,"snakkes~388b29feb9d6"],[42,45,77.22,77.34,"til~02f653494be7"],[46,51,77.34,77.85,"helga"]]},{"id":12,"start":78.55,"end":81.56,"text":"Jeg gleder meg. Ha det bra!","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"我很期待。再见！","words":[[0,3,78.63,78.91,"jeg"],[4,10,78.91,79.41,"gleder"],[11,14,79.41,79.61,"meg"],[16,18,80.74,81.08,"ha~f5b6194409e1"],[19,22,81.08,81.2,"det~58cfefde490a"],[23,26,81.2,81.48,"bra~9ed229260de6"]]},{"id":13,"start":81.63,"end":82.8,"text":"Ha det!","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"再见！","words":[[0,2,81.7,82.34,"ha~3ba917caad6f"],[3,6,82.34,82.72,"det~58cfefde490a"]]},{"id":14,"start":86.91,"end":88.02,"text":"Sammendrag","subheading":true,"zh":"内容摘要","words":[[0,10,86.99,87.94,"sammendrag"]]},{"id":15,"start":89.14,"end":91.87,"text":"Bjørnar møter Håvard i byen.","zh":"比约纳尔在城里遇见霍瓦尔。","words":[[0,7,89.22,89.82,"bjørnar"],[8,13,89.82,90.56,"møter~af568d886d8f"],[14,20,90.56,91.12,"håvard"],[21,22,91.12,91.3,"i"],[23,27,91.3,91.79,"byen"]]},{"id":16,"start":92.83,"end":94.2,"text":"De snakker sammen.","zh":"他们在交谈。","words":[[0,2,92.91,93.14,"de"],[3,10,93.14,93.6,"snakker"],[11,17,93.6,94.12,"sammen"]]},{"id":17,"start":95.34,"end":97.51,"text":"Bjørnar har mye å gjøre.","zh":"比约纳尔有很多事要做。","words":[[0,7,95.42,96.01,"bjørnar"],[8,11,96.01,96.29,"har"],[12,15,96.29,96.85,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"],[16,17,96.85,97.01,"å~0583da7a620a"],[18,23,97.01,97.43,"gjøre"]]},{"id":18,"start":98.21,"end":102.2,"text":"Han er skilt og har barna annenhver uke.","zh":"他离婚了，每隔一周带孩子。","words":[[0,3,98.29,98.7,"han"],[4,6,98.7,98.92,"er"],[7,12,98.92,99.42,"skilt~39bb7cd38da8"],[13,15,99.42,100.14,"og"],[16,19,100.14,100.36,"har"],[20,25,100.36,100.94,"barna"],[26,35,100.94,101.64,"annenhver"],[36,39,101.64,102.12,"uke"]]},{"id":19,"start":103.33,"end":106.15,"text":"Han pleier å levere barna før jobb.","zh":"他通常在上班前送孩子。","words":[[0,3,103.41,103.7,"han"],[4,10,103.7,104.18,"pleier"],[11,12,104.18,104.32,"å~0583da7a620a"],[13,19,104.32,104.8,"levere"],[20,25,104.8,105.32,"barna"],[26,29,105.32,105.68,"før~f9c047e06941"],[30,34,105.68,106.07,"jobb"]]},{"id":20,"start":106.92,"end":110.11,"text":"Det er travelt, men det går bra.","zh":"很忙，但还应付得来。","words":[[0,3,107.0,107.14,"det"],[4,6,107.14,107.44,"er"],[7,14,107.44,108.16,"travelt"],[16,19,108.58,108.94,"men"],[20,23,108.94,109.44,"det"],[24,27,109.44,109.6,"går~bdf67dea99b2"],[28,31,109.6,110.03,"bra~9ed229260de6"]]},{"id":21,"start":110.82,"end":114.81,"text":"Håvard er samboer med Marit.","zh":"霍瓦尔和玛丽特同居。","words":[[0,6,111.3,112.28,"håvard"],[7,9,112.28,113.06,"er"],[10,17,113.06,113.76,"samboer"],[18,21,113.76,113.94,"med~f0bfed2e74cc"],[22,27,113.94,114.73,"marit"]]},{"id":22,"start":115.2,"end":118.27,"text":"Håvard og Marit er lærere.","zh":"霍瓦尔和玛丽特都是老师。","words":[[0,6,115.4,116.48,"håvard"],[7,9,116.48,116.62,"og"],[10,15,116.62,117.22,"marit"],[16,18,117.22,117.48,"er"],[19,25,117.48,118.19,"lærere"]]},{"id":23,"start":119.69,"end":123.52,"text":"Bjørnar og Håvard skal gå på kafé i helga.","zh":"比约纳尔和霍瓦尔周末要去咖啡馆。","words":[[0,7,119.77,120.3,"bjørnar"],[8,10,120.3,120.62,"og"],[11,17,120.62,121.16,"håvard"],[18,22,121.16,121.86,"skal"],[23,25,121.86,122.06,"gå"],[26,28,122.06,122.22,"på~3ac21efb6a73"],[29,33,122.22,122.76,"kafé"],[34,35,122.76,122.94,"i~d4640500bb58"],[36,41,122.94,123.44,"helga"